/public/images/
/public/landing-grid/
/public/logos/
/public/hero-video*
/public/brand-story.jpg
/public/meena-bagh-bg.jpg
/public/hero-poster.jpg
/public/bento-*.jpg
/public/og-image.jpg
/public/DSC*.JPG
/public/IMG_*.jpg
/public/FullSizeRender_25.jpg
/public/media/

# ERP vendor API dump (contains credential fields)
/Busy API V2.json
